# The list of approved (or blocked) contributors for ERBoard.
#
# Only approved users listed below can open Pull Requests in this repository.
# Blocked users (prefixed with '-') are explicitly restricted from contributing.
#
# Syntax:
#  - One handle per line (without @). Sorted alphabetically.
#  - Optionally specify platform: `platform:username` (e.g., `github:kalandkar`).
#  - To block/denounce a user, prefix with minus: `-username` or `-platform:username`.
#  - Optionally, add comments after a space following the handle.
#
#
# Maintainers can approve a contributor by commenting "!approve" on a Discussion,
# or block a user by commenting "!block" on a Discussion.

